{"text": "It is crucial to recognise the potential ethical considerations arising from using AI in market research. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> For example, given that researchers use historical data to train the optimising process of AI algorithms, there is a risk that the algorithm may reinforce biased traits and or discriminatory performances. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Another underlying concern arises through how data is collected and analysed on the Internet and social media. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In some cases, it is not evident that the purpose of a website or an online game is to capture leads, and, in other cases, parts of social media conversations are taken without asking permission from the interlocutors, all of which may raise privacy concerns and or violations of data protection laws. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> To reduce these risks, companies must prioritise ethical considerations and ensure transparency and accountability in using AI. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It includes regular evaluations of AI models for potential bias or discrimination behaviour, being transparent with customers about how data is collected and used, and allowing customers to freely opt in or opt out of information provision.", "alignment": {"characters": ["I", "t", " ", "i", "s", " ", "c", "r", "u", "c", "i", "a", "l", " ", "t", "o", " ", "r", "e", "c", "o", "g", "n", "i", "s", "e", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "p", "o", "t", "e", "n", "t", "i", "a", "l", " ", "e", "t", "h", "i", "c", "a", "l", " ", "c", "o", "n", "s", "i", "d", "e", "r", "a", "t", "i", "o", "n", "s", " ", "a", "r", "i", "s", "i", "n", "g", " ", "f", "r", "o", "m", " ", "u", "s", "i", "n", "g", " ", "A", "I", " ", "i", "n", " ", "m", "a", "r", "k", "e", "t", " ", "r", "e", "s", "e", "a", "r", "c", "h", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "F", "o", "r", " ", "e", "x", "a", "m", "p", "l", "e", ",", " ", "g", "i", "v", "e", "n", " ", "t", "h",